# Documentation lags the code, so answers come from the code alone.
Docs/
*.md
# Compiled output from purs and the backend tooling.
output/
# Generated from the backend's types by nix/codegen.nix; the Haskell
# types it is generated from are indexed.
autogen/
# Old chase runs. llmq-ingest sends fresh bundles to their own folder, and
# the annotations are already in them.
*.chase
*-chase-annotations.json
# Dependency locks, sample data, mockups and logs.
package-lock.json
inventory.json
cart_mockup.html
*.log
# Batches, manifests and patches from the concat tooling.
script/
# Encrypted secrets; the content check catches them too.
secrets/